{"4813940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Definitely Not a Cult", "steam_appid": 4813940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Definitely Not a Cult</strong>, a game about running a “completely normal” community where everything is a little too friendly, a little too weird, and a little too cult-adjacent to be an accident. Build, upgrade, gather resources, unlock new systems, and keep your members in line while trying to maintain the illusion that everything is under control. Even when it clearly is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like games where comfort slowly turns into suspicion, and suspicion turns into a meme, you are in the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pyramid is watching. The town is whispering. Everyone is acting normal. That should worry you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meme-heavy atmosphere with low-key paranoia;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >base and community management;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strange characters and even stranger events;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >achievements;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian and English localization.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Definitely Not a Cult</strong>, a game about running a “completely normal” community where everything is a little too friendly, a little too weird, and a little too cult-adjacent to be an accident. Build, upgrade, gather resources, unlock new systems, and keep your members in line while trying to maintain the illusion that everything is under control. Even when it clearly is not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like games where comfort slowly turns into suspicion, and suspicion turns into a meme, you are in the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pyramid is watching. The town is whispering. Everyo